  "result": "I added `maskSecret` to `src/cli/mask.ts` and committed it as `8b8697c`. The tests pass, `tsc --noEmit` is clean, and Biome ran with `--write` on both files and reformatted one of them.\n\n`maskSecret` keeps the last four characters and replaces the rest with `*`. A value of four or fewer characters comes back unchanged, since there is nothing left to star. It counts by code point, so an emoji counts as one character.\n\nThe two `node:test` cases are in `test/cli/mask.test.ts`. They cover a normal value, a value of exactly four characters, a shorter one, and an empty string.\n\nThe task says it is finished once the change lands, but I only committed to `main` locally. I haven't pushed it or opened a PR. I also didn't run the full `npm run preflight`, and I didn't change `tasks/t-4725iva.json`, which still shows `open`.",
